      "comment": "Pulonia: Alain Guillotin's last creation",
      "content": "In Sandrone's notebook, Alain named his new invention \"Pulonia\" as he was dying. He said it was an algorithm to calculate the unknown, but could not say what the unknown is, and was unsatisfied with a stable result. His will left the savings, Pulonia and some notebooks; he suggested giving Pulonia to the Fontaine Research Institute, but Sandrone refused and kept it.",
