      "comment": "Pulonia: Rerir and the Ashen-White Order",
      "content": "Sandrone studied Rerir's abilities and fitted Pulonia with countermeasures to settle an old score. In The Ashen-White Order Burns he knocked Rerir back before Rerir bound him with vine-like arms. Columbina's light teleported the party away; Sandrone protested she had it under control.",
